---
import "../../styles/dr-quote.css";
---

<section class="dr-quote2">
  <div class="quote-content animate-on-scroll animate-scale-in">
    <h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif italic leading-tight tracking-tight mb-10">
    "Transformamos la ciencia médica en un <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-pink-400 via-orange-300 to-blue-400 italic  font-serif font-black">acto de amor</span>, protegiendo el presente para asegurar el futuro de quienes más amas."
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(236,72,153,0.8)]"></span>
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(251,146,60,0.8)]"></span>
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(96,165,250,0.8)]"></span>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-white/80 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.5em]">
        — Compromiso Pediatría
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>